  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.5.1: Documentation fixes; no code changes from v0.5.0 — corrects the README to reference the current version. Prior release — v0.5.0: Adds McpHttpClient.SetRequestHeader(name, value) so HTTP/Streamable-HTTP MCP clients can attach authentication — a bearer Authorization header or a custom API-key header — to every request, including the connection handshake and SSE stream. Passing a null/empty value removes a header. Additive and backward compatible. Prior release — v0.4.0: Splits public APIs into Voltaic.Core, Voltaic.Mcp, and Voltaic.A2A; adds dependency-light A2A v1.0 Agent Card discovery, JSON-RPC, HTTP+JSON, and gRPC clients/servers, SSE streaming, task lifecycle, push notification config APIs, extended Agent Cards, official-SDK compatibility tests, samples, and expanded Touchstone coverage.",
